  <name>MGWS Inventory</name>
  <summary>Run your clothing store</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="it">Gestisci il tuo negozio di abbigliamento</summary>

  <developer id="io.github.vincenzoferrara">
    <name>Vincenzo Ferrara</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      MGWS Inventory runs the daily work of a clothing store on top of your own online shop.
      Your WordPress and WooCommerce site is the whole backend: there is no extra server,
      database or cloud service to set up or pay for.
    </p>
    <p>
      The app sends nothing to the developer: no analytics, no telemetry, no account and no ads.
      Your data goes only to your own site and, if you turn on the optional AI help,
      to the AI provider you choose.
    </p>
    <p>With the app alone:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Products and variants with images, barcodes, prices and stock</li>
      <li>Orders, customers and coupons</li>
      <li>Dashboard with sales, products and orders, with PDF and CSV exports</li>
      <li>CalDAV calendars and contacts</li>
      <li>Optional AI help for product descriptions, with your own API key or a local Ollama server</li>
    </ul>
    <p>With the free MGWS plugin installed on your site:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Point of sale with sales, returns, exchanges, receipts and cash shifts</li>
      <li>Stock in, adjustments and transfers, with a movement ledger that can be undone</li>
      <li>Drag-and-drop designer for labels, shop signs and reports, printed on A4 sheets or label rolls</li>
      <li>Loyalty cards with points</li>
      <li>Employees and suppliers, with permissions</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      You need a WordPress site with WooCommerce. Sign in with your WordPress credentials,
      WooCommerce API keys, JWT or an application password. The interface is in English and Italian.
    </p>
  </description>

